# Integration Test Rules

- Keep integration tests in English and scenario-focused.
- Use controlled fixtures and deterministic seed data.
- Prefer containerized dependencies for PostgreSQL-backed tests.
- Avoid live portal calls in CI unless explicitly marked and isolated.
- Verify end-to-end contracts: download artifact -> transform output -> persisted rows.

# Execution Guidance

- Run integration tests only when boundary behavior changes.
- Keep unit tests as the default fast feedback mechanism.
